<title>SWEDEN: Moody's confirms Skandia ratings.</title>
<headline>Moody's confirms Skandia ratings.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. credit rating agency Moody's Investors Service said on Wednesday it confirmed Swedish insurance company Skandia's Baa1 insurance financial strength rating. About $280 million of long-term debt is affected by Skandia's ratings.  </p>
<p>Moody's also confirmed the Baa1 rating on Skandia Capital AB's senior guaranteed debt and the Baa3 rating on Skandia Insurance Company Ltd's junior subordinated debt.</p>
<p>Moody's said the ratings follow the aannouncement that Skandia has withdrawn its bid for Swedish mortgage bank Stadshypotek.</p>
<p>Skandia's ratings were placed under review by Moody's after it announced its bid. Swedish bank Handelsbanken made a higher bid for Stadshypotek.</p>
<p>Stockholm newsroom -- 46 8 700 1004</p>
